<cem:title lang="" subtitle="">Outsourcing to the Cloud: Data Security and Privacy Risks</cem:title>
<cem:description lang="">This virtual learning object "Outsourcing to the Cloud: Data Security and Privacy Risks", that is part of the level "B1.3 Intermediate" of the program "Information Systems" for the teaching of English for Specific Purposes. These objects are intended to work on Negative questions to suggest an idea, It is presented within the context of Organize Points In Arguments About Topics Related To Info Systems talk About Things People Are Supposed To Do And Things That Are Supposed To Happendetermine The Technological Needs Required To Manage Information Based On Requirements From The Company. The student will be exposed to vocabulary related to: Data Security: Vetting The Vendor, Host Data, Regulatory Compliance Issues, Data Breach. Finally, learners will develop their language skills by using an online content as well as the guidance of a SENA instructor.</cem:description>
