<cem:description>
<cem:recommendedUse lang="en">This digital resource can be used as an activity that allows the learner to reflect on the use of grammar of English language in different communicative contexts. The instuctor can work further on actitivities and tasks that help learners to improve their procedural knowledge.</cem:recommendedUse>
<cem:triggerQuestion lang="en">Have you or someone you know ever had problems when uploading your information to a cloud?, What do you think companies should consider when uploading their data to a cloud?</cem:triggerQuestion>
<cem:pedagogicalAspect lang="en">The learning objects are presented in a blended learning pedagogical approach. This means that students develop their language skills by both using an online content and attending  on site lessons. Regarding this, the students master communicative functions that are developed according to the Common European Framework standards for this level. Moreover, this learning object permits the student to develop grammar, vocabulary, reading, and writing skills.</cem:pedagogicalAspect>
<cem:learningGoal lang="en">Understand information about people’s backgrounds in spoken or written documents. Define strategies to make terms of reference and supplier assessment processes, in technology acquisition, based on established protocols.</cem:learningGoal>
</cem:description>
</cem:educational>
